://x.com/slendertaker7\",\"https://slendertaker.com\"]},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/icon-512.png\"}},\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gusion\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gusion\"},\"image\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/a888de3fe448be8f29b50a62d0193aaf.jpg\"}5e:T913,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Gusion in Mobile Legends: Jungle Burst Default\",\"description\":\"Default jungle setup for farming level four quickly, stacking magic penetration through repeated dagger hits, and deleting isolated carries.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Retribution Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Arcane Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Arcane Boots (690 gold) as item 1 in the Jungle Burst Default build for Gusion.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gusion#build-jungle-burst-default\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Genius Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Genius Wand (2,000 gold) as item 2 in the Jungle Burst Default build for Gusion.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gusion#build-jungle-burst-default\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Holy Crystal\",\"text\":\"Purchase Holy Crystal (3,000 gold) as item 3 in the Jungle Burst Default build for Gusion.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gusion#build-jungle-burst-defa