],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Honor\",\"name\":\"Gusion\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"48.21\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Gusion\",\"delta\":\"-0.12%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"1.28\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"3.11\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Honor\"}}]]}]]}]\na9:[\"$\",\"article\",\"mythical_glory\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff5d73, #ff5d7333)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 12px -2px #ff5d7380\"}}],[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1 flex-wrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#ff5d73\",\"background\":\"#ff5d731a\",\"border\":\"1px solid #ff5d7340\"},\"children\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankCardH3\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Gusion\",\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=mythical_glory\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\",\"name\":\"Gusion\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"48.65\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Gusion\",\"delta\":\"+0.32%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"1.06\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"1.65\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]]}]]}]\nab:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"The emblem question has only one real answer: \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, and Killing Spree\"}],\". Rupture's adaptive penetration converts to magic penetration because Gusion's magic power exceeds his physical attack at every point in the build. Master Assassin's lone-target damage bonus is essentially free because you are explicitly hunting isolated heroes. Killing Spree gives you the post-kill HP and movement to immediately threaten the next target. Mage Emblem is a measurable downgrade because Lethal Ignition needs three damage instances over five seconds and your combo overdelivers in 1.5 seconds, which means the proc lands on a target that is already dead.\"]}]\nac:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Mistakes that lose Gusion games\"]}]\nad:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Comboing into a target standing behind Lolita's shield.\"}],\" Her ult-blocking shield absorbs both the throw and the recall waves of S2, and S2 is more than half your combo damage. The combo that kills a 2000-HP mage does roughly 40% of its real value when the daggers hit the shield first. Wait for the shield to drop, or flank from an angle the cone does not cover. Comboing through the shield is a guaranteed waste of your rotation.\"]}]\nae:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Walking through unwarded jungle when Natalia is missing.\"}],\" Her stealth auto attack silences you for one second, and if she catches you between the ult dash and the S1 recast, the combo stops mid-rotation and you die with abilities on cooldown. Buy a Demon Hunter Sting if you have to (kidding, that does not exist on this hero). Just ward your jungle entrances and treat any \\\"Natalia missing\\\" ping as a hard \\\"do not enter fog\\\" signal until she is spotted again.\"]}]\naf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Opening S1 into Helcurt's passive range.\"}],\" His passive silences enemies who deal damage to him, which means your first S1 dagger silences \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"you\"}],\" for a full second. Reverse the skill order against Helcurt: open with S2 from outside his passive range so the daggers trigger his silence at distance, wait out the second, then S1 to mark and combo cleanly. Skill order beats the passive.\"]}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Comboing Harith without baiting Chrono Dash first.\"}],\" Harith's blink dodges the S1 teleport entirely. You land where he was, the S2 recall converges on empty ground, and your combo evaporates. Wait for him to burn Chrono Dash on a wave or a trade, then commit during the cooldown window. Comboing while his blink is up is throwing the rotation.\"]}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Pressing ult into three or more enemies because \\\"I have flicker.\\\"\"}],\" Flicker on a 120-second cooldown is not an escape from a 5-man collapse. The Gusion fantasy is one isolated kill, and the moment you ult into a cluster you stop being a hero and become a kill on the enemy scoreboard. If your only target is inside the enemy ball, the correct play is to leave and farm a side wave. Patience is not passive; impatience is the loss condition.\"]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Key tips\"]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The full combo sequence is S1 throw to mark, then S2 throw, then ult to reset both, then S1 again to teleport behind the target, then S2 recall to pull every dagger back through them. Practice in custom games until you can execute it in under 1.5 seconds. The speed is the survival tool: a 3-second combo gives the enemy time to CC you, a 1.2-second combo does not.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-1\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Gusion deals magic damage, full stop. His passive scales off magic power, every skill scales off magic power, and his penetration need is magic penetration. Physical attack items, attack speed items, and crit items do literally nothing for the combo. This is the most common mistake in auto-generated build guides and the easiest to avoid.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb5:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-2\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Weave one basic attack between S1 and S2 whenever possible. The passive procs max-HP bonus damage on that auto and heals you off Total Magic Power, which means the woven attack adds damage and gives you sustain that the rest of the kit does not. At two items, that single auto heals enough HP to matter when you walk out of the combo zone.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb6:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-3\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If S1 misses, do not commit S2 to \\\"salvage the rotation.\\\" Without the S1 mark, you cannot teleport behind the target, which means the S2 recall daggers do not converge on a single point. You lose half your damage and all your mobility, and you walk into the fight with nothing to follow up. Reset, wait the cooldown, try again.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb7:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-4\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Identify the squishiest enemy and the one with the fewest dashes during the loading screen, then mentally rehearse the combo angle on that specific hero before minute 0. Gusion's macro is \\\"find the same target every fight.\\\" If you have to pick the target on the fly, you are already too slow.\"]}]]]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>